# Multi-variadic with rest: String args go to ...ss@String, Int args go to ...ns@Int.
# Fixed param x bound to 99. Strings "hello"/"world" route to ss; 1/2 route to ns.
# ...rest catches any unmatched args (wildcard fallback — makes dispatch exhaustive).
# head of ss is "hello" (first String arg).
[call [fn [let]
  [f: [fn [let _ ...ss@String ...ns@Int ...rest] [head ss]]]
  [f 99 "hello" 1 "world" 2]]]
=== out
String("hello")
